{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/608136-reskinning-mummy-the-curse-into-angel-the-imperative","id":608136,"title":"Reskinning Mummy: the Curse into Angel: the Imperative","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-30T10:17:29-07:00","id":608136,"title":"Reskinning Mummy: the Curse into Angel: the Imperative","content":"Mummy and Demon have always been two sides of the same coin. Mummy's about being trapped in a middle-management position between dark gods with inscrutable purposes and reverent human (and ghostly) cultists. Mummy's ultimate goal is Apotheosis - an escape from the command structure of the Shan'iatu who created them. Demon takes Apotheosis as a starting point - the Fall - and is all about what you do with your freedom. Do you smash your old masters, rejoin them, or rebuild a new life?<br /> <br /> Does anyone think it might be worthwhile to reskin the Egyptian imagery of Mummy into the techgnostic imagery of Demon?<br /> <br /> <b>Transfer </b>(things that convert to Angels with little effort)<br /> <i>Memory </i>- finishing a mission means being disassembled and put back in storage, which erodes identity. Only difference is that there was probably no self to begin with (unless Angels are really repurposed Qashmallim.)<br /> <i>Cult</i> - Mummy's Cult system, with its division into Religious Tribe, Conspiracy, and Corporation, fits perfectly into Angle.<br /> <br /> <b>Transcode </b>(Things that need a bit of conversion to run on God-Machine fuel)<br /> <i>Tomb</i> - Needs to be made into an Infrastructure merit that distinguishes between the types of Infrastructure.<br /> <i>Sekhem</i> - Constantly draining Sekhem (needs a new name) provides urgency, but should be halted or recharged while in (rare) Facilities (the same kind that reduce demonic Primum.)<br /> <i>Apotheosis</i> - Demons see the Fall as something easy and Integrators see it as a failing, but the Apotheosis mechanic is based on a gradual rebuilding of identity. The requires some translation.<br /> <i>Utterances</i> <i>and Affinities</i> - Should be completely swappable between missions. Some of them may need some techgnostic reskinning.<br /> <i>Amkhata</i> - Replace with Cryptids.<br /> <br /> <b>Bad Command or Filename</b> (Things that don't transfer easily.)<br /> <i>Guilds</i> - Angels might have something like Agendas in the Demon Storyteller Guide<br /> <i>Five-fold Soul</i> - I have no idea what to do with this.<br /> <i>Death Cycle - </i>Perhaps replace Anpu with the Satan Signal that reaches Angels during storage?<br /> <i>Relics</i> - Relics aren't necessary to Angels. Mechanics should focus on constructing Occult Matrices.<br /> <i>Ephemeral nature </i>- Angels are ephemeral in the GMC and in Demon. That could be difficult to translate.<br /> <i>Angelic form</i> - hmm, uh. Hmm. <br /> <br /> Any thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":61,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","user":"Octavo","date":". 07-30-2015, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T10:47:27-07:00","id":608188,"title":"","content":"Angels are <i>naturally</i> immaterial, but it's implied in a few places that if the mission demands it the GM can keep them materialised as long as it wants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T10:49:05-07:00","id":608191,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't hew it that close, but I do like it.<br /> <br /> Grace-Power Stat. The longer you take, the more of the Machine's Grace you lose.<br /> Fuel-Essence<br /> Primum-Integrity stat. Primum is described as essentially being &quot;your place in the world&quot;, an admixture of claimed independence and metaphysical recognition from the world of that developed sense of self, a kind of connected soul in it's own right. So, Primum as Integrity/Memory.<br /> Cult-as is.<br /> Tomb-Infrastructure. It's where you get your Essence. You are made for a purpose in relation to it. Infrastructure that gives you essence is always implied to be a place rather than a person, but explore the options.<br /> Fall-'Apotheosis'. As you say, easy.<br /> Utterances and Affinities-Numina and Dread Powers. Use the Mummy Ghost rules to convert them from the ephemeral to the nine stat spread. EDIT: Alternatively, mix the two together and reskin all of them as Edicts.<br /> Cryptids-Amkhata. Easy.<br /> <br /> Skip Guilds, the Five Fold Soul, and Relics. Angel's social splat is basically the whole of the Heavenly Host, at least in theory. THe Five Fold Soul has no real place there, and Relics reeks of demonic idolatry.<br /> <br /> I'm tempted to say skip the Death Cycle as well and play up the Ephemeral Nature as a way to make them really tough. If not that though, then make it Stasis and make it so Angels have a number of returns before they have to be scrapped and rebuilt. While they are in statis, they shutdown and cut off from the Machine, existing in a temporary state of non being. Can something send a signal on that wavelength? Maybe.<br /> <br /> Angelic Form-You know what, just borrow Demonic Forms and give this as an options for full corporeality.<br /> <br /> Replace Virtue and Vice with Virtue and Imperative. Treat Imperative as Virtue and Virtue as Vice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 07-30-2015, 01:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T11:55:03-07:00","id":608264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/608136-reskinning-mummy-the-curse-into-angel-the-imperative?p=608191#post608191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't hew it that close, but I do like it.<br /> <br /> Grace-Power Stat. The longer you take, the more of the Machine's Grace you lose.<br /> Fuel-Essence<br /> Primum-Integrity stat. Primum is described as essentially being &quot;your place in the world&quot;, an admixture of claimed independence and metaphysical recognition from the world of that developed sense of self, a kind of connected soul in it's own right. So, Primum as Integrity/Memory.<br /> Cult-as is.<br /> Tomb-Infrastructure. It's where you get your Essence. You are made for a purpose in relation to it. Infrastructure that gives you essence is always implied to be a place rather than a person, but explore the options.<br /> Fall-'Apotheosis'. As you say, easy.<br /> Utterances and Affinities-Numina and Dread Powers. Use the Mummy Ghost rules to convert them from the ephemeral to the nine stat spread. EDIT: Alternatively, mix the two together and reskin all of them as Edicts.<br /> Cryptids-Amkhata. Easy.<br /> <br /> Skip Guilds, the Five Fold Soul, and Relics. Angel's social splat is basically the whole of the Heavenly Host, at least in theory. THe Five Fold Soul has no real place there, and Relics reeks of demonic idolatry.<br /> <br /> I'm tempted to say skip the Death Cycle as well and play up the Ephemeral Nature as a way to make them really tough. If not that though, then make it Stasis and make it so Angels have a number of returns before they have to be scrapped and rebuilt. While they are in statis, they shutdown and cut off from the Machine, existing in a temporary state of non being. Can something send a signal on that wavelength? Maybe.<br /> <br /> Angelic Form-You know what, just borrow Demonic Forms and give this as an options for full corporeality.<br /> <br /> Replace Virtue and Vice with Virtue and Imperative. Treat Imperative as Virtue and Virtue as Vice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good suggestions. Thanks! I especially like &quot;Grace&quot; as a name for the declining power stat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T12:24:18-07:00","id":608329,"title":"","content":"You're welcome. I'm interested in seeing where this goes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T14:45:06-07:00","id":608452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/608136-reskinning-mummy-the-curse-into-angel-the-imperative?p=608329#post608329\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're welcome. I'm interested in seeing where this goes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your idea of Primum as the Integrity stat gave me an idea. Start with Primum at 10 - you're fully connected to the God-Machine and utterly loyal. As you continue to run without being disassembled and stored, your Primum can erode. Once, you hit low levels of Primum (probably 2 since that's the highest Primum a demon can start with), you're vulnerable to Falling/Apotheosis. If the God-Machine's other agents doubt your loyalty, you can be ordered into a facility that will raise your Primum (just as it lowers a Demon's Primum.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T15:45:49-07:00","id":608522,"title":"","content":"That's also a good idea.<br /> <br /> In the original thought, Primum started low(low self-identity and place in the world) and at 9 or 10 evolved into the pre-infinity-engine-of-quantumly-defined-self that just needed the right push.(The abandonment of the Imperative). Put this way, High Primum implies a certainty of place in God's plan, while 1 and 2 Primum evokes a challenged faith, in self, in world, and in the Machine.<br /> <br /> In fact, that's a really fun idea. Maybe angel's <i>can't</i> fall, regardless of mission keeping, <i>until they lose their sense of faith</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T15:47:10-07:00","id":608525,"title":"","content":"Hmm... Since angels have Influences, would we reskin that as something like Dominions or Authorities, or would we make a cheeky nod to the Techgnosistic nature of DtD and call them Domains?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/608136-reskinning-mummy-the-curse-into-angel-the-imperative#post608136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Bad Command or Filename</b> (Things that don't transfer easily.)<br /> <i>Guilds</i> - Angels might have something like Agendas in the Demon Storyteller Guide</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't know about Agendas (angels aren't big on free will) but we do know that they have Incarnations, is there any reason why our angels wouldn't be able to just chose one of the standards: Analyst, Destroyer, Guardian, Messenger, or Psychopomp?<br /> <br /> Additional, do angels have a Cypher, or is that exclusive to the Unchained, as a result of the Fall?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T16:04:29-07:00","id":608551,"title":"","content":"While the idea of Primum as Integrity for Angels and Powerstat for Demons is very amusing in its fitting duality, I am not sure that we need new terms and mechanics.<br /> <br /> Grace can just remain Rank. Influences are described vaguely enough to do practically anything with enough Rank and Essence, but you can alter them a bit to make them cheaper for Angelic use within the Imperative. Numina are good for more flexible and general powers like unleashing mighty Blasts to evade melee combat, a higher Speed Advantage when chasing fugitives, hypnosis to erase memories of witnesses etc. Ciphers are an exceedingly personal mark of advancement in the Descent. An Angel would require self-importance to consider and desire any advantage of Unchained existence. They already have what their boss said is enough. Why ask for more? Do you wanna Fall?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-30-2015, 07:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T16:18:10-07:00","id":608584,"title":"","content":"The primary issue with using rank for a playable character is that rank 10 and supernatural potency 10 denote <i>very</i> different levels of power. Rank 10 is capital-G God tier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T16:35:10-07:00","id":608601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/608136-reskinning-mummy-the-curse-into-angel-the-imperative?p=608522#post608522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's also a good idea.<br /> <br /> In the original thought, Primum started low(low self-identity and place in the world) and at 9 or 10 evolved into the pre-infinity-engine-of-quantumly-defined-self that just needed the right push.(The abandonment of the Imperative). Put this way, High Primum implies a certainty of place in God's plan, while 1 and 2 Primum evokes a challenged faith, in self, in world, and in the Machine.<br /> <br /> In fact, that's a really fun idea. Maybe angel's <i>can't</i> fall, regardless of mission keeping, <i>until they lose their sense of faith</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a great way to handle Angelic Primum. Now we just need to add some breaking points. In no particular order yet:<br /> <br /> When you find yourself enjoying food when manifested.<br /> When you become emotionally attached to a cultist or the unwitting subject of an occult matrix or mission.<br /> When the God-Machine's plans result in your mission failing, whether by intent or by miscommunication.<br /> When you seek to avoid being recycled or put in storage.<br /> When you seek to find an excuse to get around orders.<br /> When you listen to a demon's arguments longer than your mission requires.<br /> When success in your mission clashes with your Virtue.<br /> When you take personal pride in the success of your mission.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T16:42:48-07:00","id":608610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/608136-reskinning-mummy-the-curse-into-angel-the-imperative?p=608525#post608525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... Since angels have Influences, would we reskin that as something like Dominions or Authorities, or would we make a cheeky nod to the Techgnosistic nature of DtD and call them Domains?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Don't know about Agendas (angels aren't big on free will) but we do know that they have Incarnations, is there any reason why our angels wouldn't be able to just chose one of the standards: Analyst, Destroyer, Guardian, Messenger, or Psychopomp?<br /> <br /> Additional, do angels have a Cypher, or is that exclusive to the Unchained, as a result of the Fall?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Angels would definitely fit into the standard incarnations + Analyst from Interfaces. I think Cipher would be replaced by your First Purpose, which is determined by the God-Machine when the occult matrix summoning the Angel is complete.<br /> <br /> Not sure if I would keep influences and numina or go with reskinned Utterances and Affinities, but I like the term Authorities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T16:49:35-07:00","id":608615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/608136-reskinning-mummy-the-curse-into-angel-the-imperative?p=608584#post608584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The primary issue with using rank for a playable character is that rank 10 and supernatural potency 10 denote <i>very</i> different levels of power. Rank 10 is capital-G God tier.</div> </div> </div> </div> I don't get what would be so problematic with keeping Rank. Is it dice pools for Clash Of Wills? Sure, a Rank 5 Angel has a high general power level despite &quot;only&quot; getting +5 dice for Clash Of Wills, but combined with its 12+ Simplified Resistance Attribute, I think it evens out to a fair degree.<br /> <br /> I am not sure why a PC of a major template has a Powerstat on a scale of 1 to 10 while most Ephemeral Beings have it on a 1 to 5 scale. Maybe it's part of the latter's simplified natures, in both crunch and fluff. Properly translating Ephemeral Being Rank to a 1 to 10 normal Powerstat would be too much effort for small gain, in my opinion. I would like to hear your thoughts, nevertheless. I could be wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-30-2015, 11:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T21:16:37-07:00","id":608834,"title":"","content":"I would go with Dominions as Influences, or Spheres. I stand by Numina as Edicts, or maybe Seals. Dread Powers, no idea.<br /> <br /> My understanding is that a Grace 10 Angel is the equivalent of a Rank 5 angel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T21:32:11-07:00","id":608893,"title":"","content":"Utterances-Miracles or Sealings<br /> Affinities-Ways<br /> <br /> EDIT: Fun thought-what if &quot;Imperative&quot; is a double entendre? What if, on top of meaning mission, there was a risk of the loss of Primum (or Grace) creating imps-deviant imperatives that seek to push the loss of faith or the delay of the mission? What happens to them once an angel falls?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, in case anyone wonders about the heavy theological wording, I've always had it in my head that the spectrum of characters within the God-Machine slice of the World shift focus on the word. If a Saboteur calls it the Machine, a newly fallen or not yet gone angel calls it the God-Machine, then an angel full of grace and faith sees it as God. As such, the dialogue shifts along the focus. If you ever play a game with me and want something to watch for with angels, see if you can get said angel to talk about it's slice of reality. The more divinely aspected the language, the closer to God they are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 07-31-2015, 12:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T10:23:03-07:00","id":612388,"title":"","content":"That's a good observation, Arc. I'd say that it can be paraphrased in a more general way as &quot;You can have a rough estimate of the grip on reality that a cultist retains by observing how much doubt he has about his masters.&quot; Replace cultist with any other word denoting a servant of a &quot;Black Hat&quot; faction and you are good to go.<br /> <br /> As for 1 Ephemeral Rank = 2 Grace, I can see the reasoning. But what about Rank 6+ Angels? I suppose they are better used as Big Gun NPCs that carry great risk for nearly all missions.<br /> <br /> Regarding the nomenclature of powers in this hypothetical spin-off of sorts, let's recap:<br /> <br /> Influences =&gt; Dominions/Spheres<br /> <br /> Numina =&gt; Edicts/Seals<br /> <br /> Utterances =&gt; Miracles/Sealings (I would go with &quot;Miracles&quot; because Numina-as-Seals could be confused with Utterances-as-Sealings)<br /> <br /> Affinities =&gt; Ways<br /> <br /> Dread Powers =&gt; Authorities (Remember how Biblical Angels and YHWH Himself were all about &quot;Might Makes Right&quot;? That's why you <b>really</b> should pay attention when you hear that &quot;Fear not!&quot; catchphrase. God-Machine Angels can do that too)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}